                "reply_count": 4,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "TrumpRx isn't a solution, it's a distraction. Democrats passed the Inflation Reduction Act, which allowed Medicare to negotiate drug prices for the first time, while Trump is gutting NIH and the National Cancer Institute.\n\nThis will kill innovation while most Americans won't pay any less under this \"plan.\"\n\nhttps://t.co/xpnzov9One",
